{"id":"vol9-04","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-04/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":307.27,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.8,"text":"Part 3. You will hear a mature student on a teacher training program discussing a new course with his college lecturer.","words":[["Part",0.0,0.2],["3.",0.2,0.54],["You",1.28,1.42],["will",1.42,1.58],["hear",1.58,1.78],["a",1.78,2.0],["mature",2.0,2.36],["student",2.36,2.94],["on",2.94,3.46],["a",3.46,3.6],["teacher",3.6,3.78],["training",3.78,4.18],["program",4.18,4.74],["discussing",4.74,5.42],["a",5.42,5.8],["new",5.8,5.92],["course",5.92,6.24],["with",6.24,6.8],["his",6.8,6.94],["college",6.94,7.32],["lecturer.",7.32,7.8]]},{"start":8.66,"end":13.9,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 23 on page 6.","words":[["First,",8.66,9.04],["you",9.52,9.64],["have",9.64,9.8],["some",9.8,10.0],["time",10.0,10.32],["to",10.32,10.5],["look",10.5,10.64],["at",10.64,10.78],["questions",10.78,11.22],["21",11.22,12.04],["to",12.04,12.32],["23",12.32,12.82],["on",12.82,13.26],["page",13.26,13.48],["6.",13.48,13.9]]},{"start":34.59,"end":37.71,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 23.","words":[["Now",34.59,34.79],["listen",34.79,35.01],["carefully",35.01,35.43],["and",35.43,35.69],["answer",35.69,35.95],["questions",35.95,36.31],["21",36.31,36.97],["to",36.97,37.17],["23.",37.17,37.71]]},{"start":38.25,"end":39.01,"text":"Dr Williams.","words":[["Dr",38.25,38.73],["Williams.",38.73,39.01]]},{"start":39.43,"end":39.77,"text":"Come in.","words":[["Come",39.43,39.59],["in.",39.59,39.77]]},{"start":40.01,"end":40.29,"text":"Thanks.","words":[["Thanks.",40.01,40.29]]},{"start":40.63,"end":41.49,"text":"How can I help you?","words":[["How",40.63,40.89],["can",40.89,41.01],["I",41.01,41.11],["help",41.11,41.27],["you?",41.27,41.49]]},{"start":42.19,"end":45.13,"text":"Well, I'm interested in doing the course on action research.","words":[["Well,",42.19,42.59],["I'm",43.01,43.25],["interested",43.25,43.49],["in",43.49,43.77],["doing",43.77,43.91],["the",43.91,44.07],["course",44.07,44.35],["on",44.35,44.53],["action",44.53,44.75],["research.",44.75,45.13]]},{"start":45.81,"end":48.05,"text":"Sure. What would you like to know?","words":[["Sure.",45.81,46.37],["What",47.01,47.25],["would",47.25,47.37],["you",47.37,47.49],["like",47.49,47.67],["to",47.67,47.85],["know?",47.85,48.05]]},{"start":48.05,"end":52.99,"text":"Well, first of all, I understand it's about ways of researching your own","words":[["Well,",48.05,48.91],["first",49.29,49.67],["of",49.67,49.87],["all,",49.87,50.05],["I",50.67,50.83],["understand",50.83,51.11],["it's",51.11,51.45],["about",51.45,51.63],["ways",51.63,51.89],["of",51.89,52.09],["researching",52.09,52.49],["your",52.49,52.79],["own",52.79,52.99]]},{"start":52.99,"end":58.15,"text":"practice in your professional role so as to improve it. That's right, and I'm","words":[["practice",52.99,53.35],["in",53.35,53.59],["your",53.59,53.73],["professional",53.73,54.11],["role",54.11,54.53],["so",54.53,55.03],["as",55.03,55.19],["to",55.19,55.27],["improve",55.27,55.59],["it.",55.59,55.83],["That's",56.55,56.93],["right,",56.93,57.13],["and",57.85,58.01],["I'm",58.01,58.15]]},{"start":58.15,"end":61.85,"text":"afraid I must emphasize at the outset that it's only open to working teachers.","words":[["afraid",58.15,58.41],["I",58.41,58.61],["must",58.61,58.75],["emphasize",58.75,59.27],["at",59.27,59.51],["the",59.51,59.61],["outset",59.61,60.01],["that",60.01,60.23],["it's",60.23,60.45],["only",60.45,60.65],["open",60.65,60.93],["to",60.93,61.13],["working",61.13,61.37],["teachers.",61.37,61.85]]},{"start":62.85,"end":68.37,"text":"Well, I've been one for eight years, so... That's plenty. And can I ask, will you be","words":[["Well,",62.85,63.11],["I've",63.53,63.79],["been",63.79,63.91],["one",63.91,64.07],["for",64.07,64.25],["eight",64.25,64.41],["years,",64.41,64.69],["so...",64.85,65.69],["That's",65.69,66.11],["plenty.",66.11,66.43],["And",66.69,66.91],["can",66.91,67.01],["I",67.01,67.17],["ask,",67.17,67.43],["will",67.99,68.13],["you",68.13,68.27],["be",68.27,68.37]]},{"start":68.37,"end":73.13,"text":"teaching out? Yes, I've done so for many years, but the course leader will be one","words":[["teaching",68.37,68.63],["out?",68.63,68.89],["Yes,",69.51,69.85],["I've",69.95,70.09],["done",70.09,70.23],["so",70.23,70.47],["for",70.47,70.63],["many",70.63,70.81],["years,",70.81,71.21],["but",71.67,71.89],["the",71.89,72.03],["course",72.03,72.29],["leader",72.29,72.61],["will",72.61,72.81],["be",72.81,72.97],["one",72.97,73.13]]},{"start":73.13,"end":79.87,"text":"of our new lecturers, Alan Kamner. Oh. He's just written a very interesting book on action","words":[["of",73.13,73.21],["our",73.21,73.37],["new",73.37,73.55],["lecturers,",73.55,74.05],["Alan",74.55,74.85],["Kamner.",74.85,75.43],["Oh.",76.23,76.59],["He's",77.11,77.49],["just",77.49,77.63],["written",77.63,77.93],["a",77.93,78.07],["very",78.07,78.27],["interesting",78.27,78.79],["book",78.79,79.13],["on",79.13,79.49],["action",79.49,79.87]]},{"start":79.87,"end":87.75,"text":"research, which you should get hold of. The title is Professional Learning. Right. I think","words":[["research,",79.87,80.39],["which",80.89,81.07],["you",81.07,81.25],["should",81.25,81.43],["get",81.43,81.61],["hold",81.61,81.87],["of.",81.87,82.07],["The",83.01,83.15],["title",83.15,83.49],["is",83.49,83.85],["Professional",83.85,84.55],["Learning.",84.55,85.13],["Right.",86.23,86.67],["I",87.37,87.61],["think",87.61,87.75]]},{"start":87.75,"end":92.81,"text":"one of the other teachers in my school mentioned it. Okay. Can I ask you what will be covered","words":[["one",87.75,87.91],["of",87.91,87.99],["the",87.99,88.09],["other",88.09,88.23],["teachers",88.23,88.59],["in",88.59,88.75],["my",88.75,88.89],["school",88.89,89.11],["mentioned",89.11,89.43],["it.",89.43,89.65],["Okay.",90.41,90.69],["Can",91.49,91.73],["I",91.73,91.85],["ask",91.85,92.07],["you",92.07,92.19],["what",92.19,92.31],["will",92.31,92.43],["be",92.43,92.57],["covered",92.57,92.81]]},{"start":92.81,"end":97.97,"text":"on the course? Well, the obvious aim is to develop skills in using a variety of research","words":[["on",92.81,93.01],["the",93.01,93.11],["course?",93.11,93.33],["Well,",94.25,94.57],["the",94.61,94.73],["obvious",94.73,95.03],["aim",95.03,95.29],["is",95.29,95.49],["to",95.49,95.63],["develop",95.63,95.93],["skills",95.93,96.33],["in",96.33,96.61],["using",96.61,96.87],["a",96.87,97.03],["variety",97.03,97.33],["of",97.33,97.65],["research",97.65,97.97]]},{"start":97.97,"end":102.31,"text":"techniques. Yes, of course. I'll ask you about those in more detail later.","words":[["techniques.",97.97,98.45],["Yes,",99.19,99.55],["of",99.65,99.75],["course.",99.75,99.97],["I'll",100.35,100.53],["ask",100.53,100.73],["you",100.73,100.83],["about",100.83,101.01],["those",101.01,101.25],["in",101.25,101.43],["more",101.43,101.59],["detail",101.59,101.91],["later.",101.91,102.31]]},{"start":102.31,"end":107.69,"text":"And then there's something that's crucial to action research, and that's the skill of researching in a team.","words":[["And",102.31,103.05],["then",103.05,103.23],["there's",103.23,103.47],["something",103.47,103.67],["that's",103.67,103.97],["crucial",103.97,104.31],["to",104.31,104.55],["action",104.55,104.83],["research,",104.83,105.25],["and",105.67,105.89],["that's",105.89,106.15],["the",106.15,106.27],["skill",106.27,106.49],["of",106.49,106.63],["researching",106.63,107.11],["in",107.11,107.35],["a",107.35,107.47],["team.",107.47,107.69]]},{"start":108.31,"end":116.43,"text":"Yes. I can say that it is very important. And what about after you've done the research? Do you do something on dissemination of findings?","words":[["Yes.",108.31,108.79],["I",109.39,109.63],["can",109.63,109.77],["say",109.77,109.99],["that",109.99,110.15],["it",110.15,110.27],["is",110.27,110.43],["very",110.43,110.65],["important.",110.65,111.11],["And",111.75,111.99],["what",111.99,112.11],["about",112.11,112.35],["after",112.35,112.71],["you've",112.71,112.97],["done",112.97,113.13],["the",113.13,113.29],["research?",113.29,113.69],["Do",114.33,114.47],["you",114.47,114.59],["do",114.59,114.71],["something",114.71,115.07],["on",115.07,115.25],["dissemination",115.25,115.93],["of",115.93,116.09],["findings?",116.09,116.43]]},{"start":117.41,"end":125.69,"text":"Well, the last major objective is similar to that, but not quite the same. It's on presenting results as part of the wider collaborative culture.","words":[["Well,",117.41,117.77],["the",117.87,118.01],["last",118.01,118.31],["major",118.31,118.57],["objective",118.57,119.09],["is",119.09,119.37],["similar",119.37,119.65],["to",119.65,119.85],["that,",119.85,120.03],["but",120.47,120.61],["not",120.61,120.77],["quite",120.77,120.99],["the",120.99,121.19],["same.",121.19,121.45],["It's",122.23,122.51],["on",122.51,122.63],["presenting",122.63,123.01],["results",123.01,123.49],["as",123.49,123.79],["part",123.79,124.01],["of",124.01,124.21],["the",124.21,124.33],["wider",124.33,124.65],["collaborative",124.65,125.11],["culture.",125.11,125.69]]},{"start":126.45,"end":161.31,"text":"before you hear the rest of the discussion you have some time to look at questions 24 to 30 on page 7 now listen and answer questions 24 to 30 great well that's very helpful I can ask you about the different components","words":[["before",126.45,127.01],["you",127.01,127.29],["hear",127.29,127.45],["the",127.45,127.59],["rest",127.59,127.81],["of",127.81,127.93],["the",127.93,128.01],["discussion",128.01,128.47],["you",128.47,129.21],["have",129.21,129.39],["some",129.39,129.55],["time",129.55,129.83],["to",129.83,129.99],["look",129.99,130.09],["at",130.09,130.23],["questions",130.23,130.59],["24",130.59,131.23],["to",131.23,131.43],["30",131.43,131.71],["on",131.71,131.97],["page",131.97,132.21],["7",132.21,132.61],["now",132.61,133.61],["listen",153.45,153.75],["and",153.75,153.99],["answer",153.99,154.25],["questions",154.25,154.63],["24",154.63,155.35],["to",155.35,155.55],["30",155.55,155.87],["great",155.87,156.99],["well",156.99,157.87],["that's",157.87,158.45],["very",158.45,158.63],["helpful",158.63,158.95],["I",158.95,159.73],["can",159.73,159.85],["ask",159.85,160.05],["you",160.05,160.19],["about",160.19,160.37],["the",160.37,160.55],["different",160.55,160.77],["components",160.77,161.31]]},{"start":161.31,"end":171.47,"text":"well the course is organized around the data gathering techniques and we divide them into two main types observational and non observational techniques","words":[["well",161.31,162.33],["the",162.33,162.49],["course",162.49,162.71],["is",162.71,162.91],["organized",162.91,163.25],["around",163.25,163.67],["the",163.67,163.85],["data",163.85,164.15],["gathering",164.15,164.57],["techniques",164.57,165.09],["and",165.09,165.79],["we",165.79,165.93],["divide",165.93,166.21],["them",166.21,166.53],["into",166.53,166.79],["two",166.79,167.07],["main",167.07,167.45],["types",167.45,167.99],["observational",167.99,169.35],["and",169.35,169.83],["non",169.83,170.11],["observational",170.11,170.91],["techniques",170.91,171.47]]},{"start":171.99,"end":177.19,"text":"And between each session, we ask you to try out the technique for yourself in a variety","words":[["And",171.99,172.51],["between",172.51,172.81],["each",172.81,173.13],["session,",173.13,173.45],["we",173.89,174.07],["ask",174.07,174.29],["you",174.29,174.45],["to",174.45,174.55],["try",174.55,174.77],["out",174.77,175.01],["the",175.01,175.15],["technique",175.15,175.55],["for",175.55,175.81],["yourself",175.81,176.23],["in",176.23,176.73],["a",176.73,176.83],["variety",176.83,177.19]]},{"start":177.19,"end":177.83,"text":"of settings.","words":[["of",177.19,177.49],["settings.",177.49,177.83]]},{"start":178.65,"end":181.79,"text":"The initial sessions are on using observation checklists.","words":[["The",178.65,178.77],["initial",178.77,179.07],["sessions",179.07,179.47],["are",179.47,179.79],["on",179.79,179.91],["using",179.91,180.17],["observation",180.17,180.95],["checklists.",180.95,181.79]]},{"start":182.45,"end":182.99,"text":"Oh yes.","words":[["Oh",182.45,182.73],["yes.",182.73,182.99]]},{"start":183.49,"end":187.55,"text":"And we ask you to try some out in a school so you can look at an element of a lesson","words":[["And",183.49,183.73],["we",183.73,183.85],["ask",183.85,184.07],["you",184.07,184.23],["to",184.23,184.35],["try",184.35,184.61],["some",184.61,184.87],["out",184.87,185.15],["in",185.15,185.31],["a",185.31,185.41],["school",185.41,185.67],["so",185.67,185.91],["you",185.91,186.05],["can",186.05,186.19],["look",186.19,186.37],["at",186.37,186.55],["an",186.55,186.67],["element",186.67,186.89],["of",186.89,187.15],["a",187.15,187.27],["lesson",187.27,187.55]]},{"start":187.55,"end":192.69,"text":"such as pupil behavior, so you can immediately apply what you've learnt to a real situation","words":[["such",187.55,187.87],["as",187.87,188.07],["pupil",188.07,188.35],["behavior,",188.35,188.91],["so",189.27,189.71],["you",189.71,189.87],["can",189.87,190.03],["immediately",190.03,190.37],["apply",190.37,190.79],["what",190.79,191.13],["you've",191.13,191.41],["learnt",191.41,191.63],["to",191.63,191.81],["a",191.81,191.93],["real",191.93,192.11],["situation",192.11,192.69]]},{"start":192.69,"end":193.59,"text":"in the classroom.","words":[["in",192.69,192.99],["the",192.99,193.09],["classroom.",193.09,193.59]]},{"start":194.25,"end":194.77,"text":"Right?","words":[["Right?",194.25,194.77]]},{"start":195.23,"end":196.97,"text":"Somebody told me we have to keep a diary.","words":[["Somebody",195.23,195.57],["told",195.57,195.83],["me",195.83,195.99],["we",195.99,196.13],["have",196.13,196.27],["to",196.27,196.37],["keep",196.37,196.55],["a",196.55,196.67],["diary.",196.67,196.97]]},{"start":197.51,"end":198.33,"text":"Yes, that's right.","words":[["Yes,",197.51,197.83],["that's",197.87,198.13],["right.",198.13,198.33]]},{"start":198.33,"end":200.77,"text":"We ask you to keep one as a research tool.","words":[["We",198.33,198.99],["ask",198.99,199.19],["you",199.19,199.35],["to",199.35,199.43],["keep",199.43,199.61],["one",199.61,199.81],["as",199.81,199.93],["a",199.93,200.03],["research",200.03,200.35],["tool.",200.35,200.77]]},{"start":201.19,"end":202.71,"text":"And what's the point of that exactly?","words":[["And",201.19,201.55],["what's",201.55,201.75],["the",201.75,201.83],["point",201.83,202.07],["of",202.07,202.19],["that",202.19,202.31],["exactly?",202.31,202.71]]},{"start":203.41,"end":205.95,"text":"Well, it really enhances your capacity for reflection.","words":[["Well,",203.41,203.57],["it",203.59,203.71],["really",203.71,203.97],["enhances",203.97,204.45],["your",204.45,204.67],["capacity",204.67,205.15],["for",205.15,205.45],["reflection.",205.45,205.95]]},{"start":206.83,"end":208.25,"text":"Oh, that sounds interesting.","words":[["Oh,",206.83,207.27],["that",207.29,207.49],["sounds",207.49,207.73],["interesting.",207.73,208.25]]},{"start":208.73,"end":213.35,"text":"And then we've just added another observational technique to the course which is video recording.","words":[["And",208.73,209.09],["then",209.09,209.27],["we've",209.27,209.53],["just",209.53,209.67],["added",209.67,209.95],["another",209.95,210.25],["observational",210.25,211.05],["technique",211.05,211.53],["to",211.53,211.75],["the",211.75,211.85],["course",211.85,212.13],["which",212.13,212.37],["is",212.37,212.53],["video",212.53,212.83],["recording.",212.83,213.35]]},{"start":214.09,"end":218.25,"text":"I have tried that already with colleagues. I have to say with only limited success.","words":[["I",214.09,214.53],["have",214.53,214.65],["tried",214.65,214.85],["that",214.85,215.07],["already",215.07,215.37],["with",215.37,215.59],["colleagues.",215.59,215.93],["I",216.47,216.65],["have",216.65,216.81],["to",216.81,216.93],["say",216.93,217.11],["with",217.11,217.25],["only",217.25,217.51],["limited",217.51,217.85],["success.",217.85,218.25]]},{"start":218.95,"end":223.25,"text":"Yes, that's been our experience too, especially at the beginning.","words":[["Yes,",218.95,219.25],["that's",219.81,220.19],["been",220.19,220.33],["our",220.33,220.55],["experience",220.55,221.05],["too,",221.05,221.39],["especially",221.79,222.59],["at",222.59,222.85],["the",222.85,222.93],["beginning.",222.93,223.25]]},{"start":223.25,"end":230.99,"text":"So we decided to get you to try this technique out with your fellow students in classroom simulation, which I think you'll agree.","words":[["So",223.25,223.87],["we",223.87,224.65],["decided",224.65,225.03],["to",225.03,225.33],["get",225.33,225.45],["you",225.45,225.63],["to",225.63,225.77],["try",225.77,225.97],["this",225.97,226.19],["technique",226.19,226.61],["out",226.61,227.01],["with",227.01,227.61],["your",227.61,227.77],["fellow",227.77,228.01],["students",228.01,228.47],["in",228.47,228.73],["classroom",228.73,229.09],["simulation,",229.09,229.73],["which",229.91,230.11],["I",230.11,230.27],["think",230.27,230.41],["you'll",230.41,230.69],["agree.",230.69,230.99]]},{"start":231.73,"end":233.29,"text":"That has fewer problems, yes.","words":[["That",231.73,231.97],["has",231.97,232.19],["fewer",232.19,232.45],["problems,",232.45,232.95],["yes.",233.03,233.29]]},{"start":233.85,"end":238.09,"text":"And then we have sessions examining what we call non-observational techniques.","words":[["And",233.85,234.03],["then",234.03,234.17],["we",234.17,234.31],["have",234.31,234.53],["sessions",234.53,234.93],["examining",234.93,235.45],["what",235.45,235.71],["we",235.71,235.89],["call",235.89,236.15],["non",236.15,236.57],["-observational",236.57,237.49],["techniques.",237.49,238.09]]},{"start":238.77,"end":242.71,"text":"And rather controversially, we start with ways of scrutinising test results.","words":[["And",238.77,238.95],["rather",238.95,239.19],["controversially,",239.19,240.01],["we",240.15,240.21],["start",240.21,240.49],["with",240.49,240.73],["ways",240.73,240.97],["of",240.97,241.15],["scrutinising",241.15,241.85],["test",241.85,242.19],["results.",242.19,242.71]]},{"start":243.79,"end":246.29,"text":"Oh right. Yeah, I'm familiar with that.","words":[["Oh",243.79,244.15],["right.",244.15,244.41],["Yeah,",245.13,245.41],["I'm",245.51,245.61],["familiar",245.61,245.89],["with",245.89,246.15],["that.",246.15,246.29]]},{"start":246.77,"end":249.83,"text":"Yes, but we think these can yield some very valuable insights.","words":[["Yes,",246.77,247.19],["but",247.31,247.43],["we",247.43,247.59],["think",247.59,247.79],["these",247.79,248.01],["can",248.01,248.23],["yield",248.23,248.47],["some",248.47,248.67],["very",248.67,248.95],["valuable",248.95,249.31],["insights.",249.31,249.83]]},{"start":249.83,"end":254.19,"text":"We ask you to bring along statistics relating to your own students for this.","words":[["We",249.83,250.43],["ask",250.43,250.67],["you",250.67,250.83],["to",250.83,250.93],["bring",250.93,251.07],["along",251.07,251.33],["statistics",251.33,251.89],["relating",251.89,252.69],["to",252.69,252.99],["your",252.99,253.15],["own",253.15,253.29],["students",253.29,253.65],["for",253.65,253.95],["this.",253.95,254.19]]},{"start":254.61,"end":258.55,"text":"Oh, that should be easy. I have to say I quite enjoy that kind of analysis.","words":[["Oh,",254.61,255.05],["that",255.07,255.25],["should",255.25,255.39],["be",255.39,255.55],["easy.",255.55,255.87],["I",256.25,256.43],["have",256.43,256.53],["to",256.53,256.63],["say",256.63,256.83],["I",256.83,256.97],["quite",256.97,257.19],["enjoy",257.19,257.55],["that",257.55,257.83],["kind",257.83,258.05],["of",258.05,258.17],["analysis.",258.17,258.55]]},{"start":259.19,"end":262.73,"text":"Yes. And then we look at using questionnaires.","words":[["Yes.",259.19,259.63],["And",260.51,260.95],["then",260.95,261.05],["we",261.05,261.21],["look",261.21,261.39],["at",261.39,261.65],["using",261.65,262.03],["questionnaires.",262.03,262.73]]},{"start":262.89,"end":266.15,"text":"Oh, yes. I've done one or two projects involving those.","words":[["Oh,",262.89,263.13],["yes.",263.15,263.43],["I've",264.01,264.23],["done",264.23,264.39],["one",264.39,264.57],["or",264.57,264.69],["two",264.69,264.89],["projects",264.89,265.31],["involving",265.31,265.75],["those.",265.75,266.15]]},{"start":266.69,"end":272.29,"text":"I used one local teachers resource group, but I've never felt that I've used them as effectively as I should have done so.","words":[["I",266.69,266.87],["used",266.87,267.09],["one",267.09,267.31],["local",267.31,267.63],["teachers",267.63,268.03],["resource",268.03,268.43],["group,",268.43,268.83],["but",268.93,269.21],["I've",269.21,269.35],["never",269.35,269.53],["felt",269.53,269.81],["that",269.81,269.97],["I've",269.97,270.17],["used",270.17,270.37],["them",270.37,270.55],["as",270.55,270.69],["effectively",270.69,271.09],["as",271.09,271.41],["I",271.41,271.53],["should",271.53,271.69],["have",271.69,271.83],["done",271.83,272.01],["so.",272.01,272.29]]},{"start":272.95,"end":275.43,"text":"Well, that is a common comment from our participants.","words":[["Well,",272.95,273.35],["that",273.37,273.53],["is",273.53,273.67],["a",273.67,273.77],["common",273.77,274.03],["comment",274.03,274.47],["from",274.47,274.67],["our",274.67,274.87],["participants.",274.87,275.43]]},{"start":275.43,"end":282.73,"text":"And we thought we'd open things up a bit this year with a different approach and use the internet in order to identify respondents.","words":[["And",275.43,275.97],["we",275.97,276.53],["thought",276.53,276.73],["we'd",276.73,277.01],["open",277.01,277.21],["things",277.21,277.51],["up",277.51,277.71],["a",277.71,277.83],["bit",277.83,277.93],["this",277.93,278.19],["year",278.19,278.43],["with",278.43,278.59],["a",278.59,278.71],["different",278.71,278.93],["approach",278.93,279.35],["and",279.35,280.15],["use",280.15,280.37],["the",280.37,280.57],["internet",280.57,280.93],["in",280.93,281.23],["order",281.23,281.41],["to",281.41,281.57],["identify",281.57,282.15],["respondents.",282.15,282.73]]},{"start":283.79,"end":287.49,"text":"Obviously we'd explain more about how that will work closer to the time.","words":[["Obviously",283.79,284.31],["we'd",284.31,284.63],["explain",284.63,284.99],["more",284.99,285.29],["about",285.29,285.53],["how",285.53,285.79],["that",285.79,285.95],["will",285.95,286.11],["work",286.11,286.45],["closer",286.45,286.91],["to",286.91,287.09],["the",287.09,287.19],["time.",287.19,287.49]]},{"start":288.21,"end":291.65,"text":"Great. Look forward to that. And will there be anything on interviews?","words":[["Great.",288.21,288.45],["Look",288.91,289.17],["forward",289.17,289.47],["to",289.47,289.65],["that.",289.65,289.85],["And",290.29,290.49],["will",290.49,290.61],["there",290.61,290.77],["be",290.77,290.89],["anything",290.89,291.19],["on",291.19,291.35],["interviews?",291.35,291.65]]},{"start":292.41,"end":299.27,"text":"That's really the last major section and we ask you to choose your own respondents for that as part of a final project.","words":[["That's",292.41,292.75],["really",292.75,293.01],["the",293.01,293.21],["last",293.21,293.53],["major",293.53,293.87],["section",293.87,294.33],["and",294.33,294.97],["we",294.97,295.11],["ask",295.11,295.39],["you",295.39,295.57],["to",295.57,295.67],["choose",295.67,295.91],["your",295.91,296.15],["own",296.15,296.33],["respondents",296.33,296.77],["for",296.77,297.11],["that",297.11,297.33],["as",297.33,297.93],["part",297.93,298.15],["of",298.15,298.35],["a",298.35,298.45],["final",298.45,298.75],["project.",298.75,299.27]]},{"start":299.87,"end":304.01,"text":"Great. Well, that's been really helpful, Dr Williams. Thank you.","words":[["Great.",299.87,300.39],["Well,",300.77,300.99],["that's",301.41,301.65],["been",301.65,301.77],["really",301.77,301.95],["helpful,",301.95,302.29],["Dr",302.43,302.57],["Williams.",302.57,302.83],["Thank",303.49,303.77],["you.",303.77,304.01]]},{"start":304.43,"end":305.83,"text":"That is the end of part 3.","words":[["That",304.43,304.75],["is",304.75,304.93],["the",304.93,305.05],["end",305.05,305.21],["of",305.21,305.31],["part",305.31,305.49],["3.",305.49,305.83]]},{"start":306.77,"end":307.23,"text":"You now have...","words":[["You",306.77,306.93],["now",306.93,307.09],["have...",307.09,307.23]]}]}